    "*From PROJECT_BRIEF.md - Phase 1: Foundation (Weeks 1-4)*\n",
    "\n",
    "## Objective: Load and analyze vector data layers\n",
    "\n",
    "Key operations this week:\n",
    "- Load shapefiles (USGS basins, end-users) with GeoPandas\n",
    "- Inspect geometry and attributes\n",
    "- Perform spatial joins and intersections\n",
    "- Clip basins to our ROI (Southern Africa)\n    "- Analyze proximity to end-users\n    "\n",
    "## Vector Data Loading\n",
    "\n",
    "### Loading Shapefiles\n",
    "\n",
    "`geopandas.read_file()` supports:\n",
    "- `.shp` files (ESRI Shapefile)\n",
    "- `.geojson` files\n",
    "- `.gpkg` files (GeoPackage)\n",
    "- `.json` files\n",
    "\n",
    "### Inspecting Data\n",
    "\n",
    "- `gdf.head()` - first 5 rows\n",
    "- `gdf.columns` - column names\n",
    "- `gdf.crs` - Coordinate Reference System\n",
    "- `gdf.total_bounds` - (minx, miny, maxx, maxy)\n",
    "- `len(gdf)` - number of features\n",
    "\n",
    "### Common Geometry Types\n",
    "- `Point`: Single coordinate (x, y)\n",
    "- `LineString`: Sequence of points\n",
    "- `Polygon`: Closed ring of points\n",
    "- `MultiPoint`: Multiple points\n",
    "- `MultiPolygon`: Multiple polygons\n",
    "\n",
    "### Accessing CRS\n",
    "- `print(gdf.crs)` - shows CRS\n",
    "- `gdf = gdf.set_crs(epsg=4326, inplace=False)` - set WGS84\n",
    "- `gdf.total_bounds` - bounding box\n",
    "\n",
    "## Common Operations\n",
    "\n",
    ### Filtering\n",
    "- `result = gdf[gdf['porosity'] > 0.25]` - select by attribute\n",
    "- `result = gdf[gdf.geometry.contains(some_point)]` - select by geometry\n",
    "\n",
    ### Projection\n",
    "- `gdf_proj = gdf.to_crs(epsg=3857)` - Web Mercator\n",
    "- `gdf = gdf.to_crs(other_gdf.crs)` - match another dataset\n",
    "\n",
    ### Geometry Operations\n",
    "- `gdf['area'] = gdf.geometry.area` - area in CRS units\n",
    "- `gdf['length'] = gdf.geometry.length` - length\n",
    "- `gdf['buffered'] = gdf.geometry.buffer(1.0)` - 1 degree buffer\n",
    "- `gdf['centroid'] = gdf.geometry.centroid` - centroid point",
   ]
  },
