    "## Spatial Operations\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1. Spatial Join (Join by Location)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Purpose:** Find which basins are near/inside which user areas, or vice versa.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 2. Intersection\n",
    "\n",
    "**Purpose:** Find areas where basins overlap with user proximity zones.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 3. Buffer Creation\n",
    "\n",
    "**Purpose:** Create zones around features (e.g., 50km around basins, 10km around ports).\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4. Clipping\n",
    "\n",
    "**Purpose:** Clip basins to ROI boundary\n",
    "\n",
    "### 5. Proximity Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "**Purpose:** Find basins within X km of end-users\n",
    "\n",
    "### 6. Clipping Basins to ROI\n",
    "\n",
    "### 7. Buffer Creation\n",
    "\n",
    "**Purpose:** Create zones around features\n",
    "\n",
    "### 8. Spatial Join Examples\n",
    "\n",
    "**Example: Which basins intersect the ROI?**\n",
    "\n",
    "# Create ROI polygon (Southern Africa focus)\n",
    "roi = box(12.0, -20.0, 22.0, -10.0)\n",
    "roi_gdf = gpd.GeoDataFrame({'geometry': [roi]}, crs='EPSG:4326')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Method 1: sjoin without 'op' parameter (default intersection)\n",
    "basins_intersecting = gpd.sjoin(basins, roi_gdf, how='inner')\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Basins intersecting ROI: {len(basins_intersecting)} out of {len(basins)}')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Method 2: Using intersects property\n",
    "basins_in_roi = basins[basins.intersects(roi_gdf.unary_union)]\n",
    "print(f'Basins in ROI (intersects property): {len(basins_in_roi)}')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Buffer method\n",
    "basins_buffered = basins.copy()\n",
    "basins_buffered['geometry'] = basins.buffer(1.0)  # 1 degree buffer\n",
    "basins_in_buffer = basins_buffered[basins_buffered.intersects(roi_gdf.unary_union)]\n",
    "print(f'Basins with 1deg buffer in ROI: {len(basins_in_buffer)}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Create buffer around basins (1-degree buffer = ~111km)\n",
    "basins_buffered = basins.copy()\n",
    "basins_buffered['geometry'] = basins.buffer(1.0)\n",
    "\n",
    "# How many basins have buffers within our study area?\n",
    "basins_in_buffer = gpd.sjoin(basins_buffered, roi_gdf, how='inner', op='intersects')\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Basins with 1deg buffer in ROI: {len(basins_in_buffer)} out of {len(basins)}')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Create buffer around end-users (0.5-degree buffer = ~55km)\n",
    "users_buffered = users.copy()\n",
    "users_buffered['geometry'] = users.buffer(0.5)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Which basin-user pairs are within 55km of each other?\n",
    "joined = gpd.sjoin(basins_buffered, users_buffered, how='inner', op='intersects')\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Basin-user intersections (within 55km): {len(joined)}')\n",
    "if len(joined) > 0:\n",
    "    print('Sample intersections:')\n",
    "    for _, row in joined.head().iterrows():\n",
    "        print(f'  Basin {row.basin_id} <-> User {row.user_id}')"
   ]
